# the pressure crossfade (v0.2): a scene key held is a fader into its scene. Drone I's cutoff (par7) shows
# where the sound is: scene A1 at 700, the sound before it at 300. The pressure is where the sound heads; it
# glides there no faster than the whole way in a Scene time (here 1.1 s: Setup 1 KNOB 3 at 30), after the
# first 250 ms (a tap so far)
set 71 30
# Pitch lock off (on at start since 2026-10-19): these move the pitch
set 74 0
# bank A (a new FM-1 starts on the Presets, which are fixed)
press SEL
tapkey w12
release SEL
pressure w0 0
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
wait 300
spin K2 -40
wait 300
expect par7 300
# a light rest: nothing moves
key w0 down
pressure w0 5
wait 400
expect par7 300
# half way in (pressure 64 of 127: ~52 %)
pressure w0 64
wait 800
expect par7 >480
expect par7 <540
# let go: the blend stays, a sound of its own (v0.3; it went back unless SEL held it)
key w0 up
wait 1200
expect par7 >480
expect par7 <540
expect scene_at -1
# SEL + SAVE: undo, back to the sound before the blend, over the Scene time
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
# ... and again: forward to the blend
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 >480
expect par7 <540
# back to before it, for what follows
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
# SEL tapped while it's held, half way: the blend kept there, as a gesture's (Evan, 2026-10-30); pressing on moves
# nothing, and the let-go keeps it too
key w0 down
pressure w0 64
wait 800
tap SEL
pressure w0 127
wait 800
expect par7 >480
expect par7 <540
key w0 up
wait 1200
expect par7 >480
expect par7 <540
expect scene_at -1
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
# a tap (let go under half a second), however hard: there, over the Scene time (1.1 s), and stay
key w0 down
pressure w0 127
wait 100
key w0 up
wait 1600
expect par7 700
expect scene_at 0
# a relaxed tap (0.4 s, a light press): the scene too, to stay (Evan, 2026-10-18: it went BACK)
spin K2 -40
wait 300
expect scene_at -1
key w0 down
pressure w0 40
wait 400
key w0 up
wait 1600
expect par7 700
expect scene_at 0
# pressed through (held near full for 0.3 s): taken, and it stays after letting go. Pressed hard at once it
# glides in over the Scene time, not a jump (Evan, 2026-10-19)
spin K2 -40
wait 300
expect scene_at -1
key w0 down
pressure w0 127
wait 400
expect par7 <450
wait 1100
expect par7 700
key w0 up
wait 1200
expect par7 700
expect scene_at 0
# the finger lifting (its pressure falling on the way up) before the key lets go doesn't take the blend back: let
# go, it stays where it was a moment before
spin K2 -40
wait 300
key w0 down
pressure w0 64
wait 1000
pressure w0 30
wait 60
pressure w0 0
wait 40
key w0 up
wait 600
expect par7 >470
expect par7 <540
expect scene_at -1
# undone: back to the sound before it
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
# a tap held past the crossfade's start (350 ms): undo goes back to the sound before the press, not to the
# blend it had begun (the review, 2026-10-27)
key w0 down
pressure w0 100
wait 350
key w0 up
wait 1600
expect par7 700
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
# undo leaves the room's settings (Stereo) where they are
tapkey w0
wait 1600
expect par7 700
set 53 90
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 1300
expect par7 300
expect par53 90
set 53 60
# turning ALGORITHM (Movement, par75) while a scene switch is on its way: the switch lets go of it, and the
# rest still lands (scene A2 stored with Movement 50 and cutoff 700; the sound at Movement 80, cutoff 300)
spin K2 40
wait 300
press SAVE
tapkey w1
release SAVE
wait 300
spin K2 -40
spin ALGO 30
wait 300
expect par75 80
tap GLO
spin K3 20
tap HOME
tapkey w1
wait 400
spin ALGO 10
wait 200
spin ALGO 5
wait 7500
expect par75 >90
expect par7 700
